---
import MainLayout from "../../../../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import LocationLocalFlavor from "../../../../components/LocationLocalFlavor.astro";
import { sp, compose2, townAnchor } from "../../../../data/serviceCopy";
import { locations } from "../../../../data/locations";
import type { Location } from "../../../../data/locations";

export function getStaticPaths() {
  return locations.map((loc) => ({
    params: { location: loc.slug },
    props: { location: loc },
  }));
}

interface Props { location: Location; }
const { location } = Astro.props;
const { city, state, slug, county } = location;

const heroP = sp(slug, "hero", [
  `1st Capital Locksmith provides full ignition cylinder replacement throughout ${city} and ${county}. When a cylinder is too worn, cracked, or damaged to repair, we replace it on-site and key it to your existing key — no dealership, no tow.`,
  `When an ignition cylinder in ${city} is past saving, replacement done right matters. 1st Capital Locksmith replaces cylinders on-site throughout ${city} and ${county} — matched to your existing key, with new keys cut and programmed on the spot.`,
  `A failed ignition cylinder doesn't have to mean a dealership visit. 1st Capital Locksmith replaces ignition cylinders wherever your vehicle sits in ${city} — all makes and models, done in one mobile visit.`,
  `Cracked, seized, or broken-into — when the cylinder has to go, 1st Capital Locksmith replaces it at your ${city} location and hands you keys that work before we leave. Serving all of ${county}.`,
]);

const card1 = sp(slug, "card-1", [
  `Not every ignition problem can be repaired. A cylinder that is cracked, severely corroded, has a broken wafer or housing, or sustained damage from a forced entry or break-in attempt often requires full replacement. We assess the cylinder honestly and give you a clear recommendation — we only suggest replacement when it's genuinely the right call. We always attempt ignition repair first.`,
  `We repair ignitions whenever the cylinder can be saved — but cracks, severe corrosion, broken wafers, and break-in damage cross the line into replacement territory. You'll get an honest assessment from us in ${city}, and we'll never push a replacement that a repair would fix.`,
  `Some cylinders are simply done: cracked housings, broken wafers, corrosion, or damage from a theft attempt. Our rule in ${city} is repair first, replace second — and when replacement is the answer, we tell you exactly why.`,
  `An honest diagnosis comes first: if your ignition can be repaired, that's what we recommend. When it can't — cracked, corroded, or damaged by forced entry — we explain why replacement is the right call before any work starts.`,
]);

const card2 = sp(slug, "card-2", [
  `Every ignition cylinder replacement includes cutting a new key to match the new cylinder. For modern vehicles with transponder or smart key systems, we program the new key to the vehicle's immobilizer on-site in ${city}. You leave with a fully functional key that works in both your door locks and ignition — no dealership visit needed.`,
  `A new cylinder needs keys to match — we cut them on the spot, and for transponder or smart key vehicles we program them to the immobilizer at your ${city} location. One visit covers cylinder, keys, and programming.`,
  `Replacement includes fresh keys cut for the new cylinder, plus immobilizer programming for chipped and smart key vehicles — all done where your car sits in ${city}. Where possible, we key the new cylinder to your existing key instead.`,
  `We cut and program keys for the new cylinder on-site in ${city}, so you drive away with everything working — doors and ignition on one key whenever the hardware allows.`,
]);

const card3 = compose2(slug, "card-3", {
  open: [
    `Theft attempts and break-ins frequently damage the ignition cylinder — sometimes beyond repair.`,
    `A thief's screwdriver does more damage in seconds than years of normal use.`,
    `Forced entry destroys ignitions — cracked housings and mangled wafers are the usual result.`,
    `After an attempted theft, the ignition is often the worst casualty.`,
  ],
  close: [
    `If your vehicle's ignition was damaged during an attempted theft or forced entry in ${city}, we can replace the cylinder and restore proper function on-site. We work alongside insurance claims and provide documentation if needed.`,
    `We replace theft-damaged ignitions on-site in ${city}, and we document the work for your insurance claim if you're filing one.`,
    `If this happened to your vehicle in ${city}, we replace the cylinder on-site and provide any documentation your insurer asks for.`,
    townAnchor(slug, "automotive", "card-3"),
  ],
});

const card4 = compose2(slug, "card-4", {
  open: [
    `We carry ignition cylinder stock and have access to replacement parts for a wide range of domestic and import vehicle makes and model years.`,
    `Our parts access covers a wide range of domestic and import ignitions across model years.`,
    `Common cylinders ride on our trucks; less common ones we source quickly.`,
    `Domestic or import, common or uncommon — ignition parts for most vehicles are either on the truck or a quick source away.`,
  ],
  close: [
    `If we don't have the part on our mobile unit, we can typically source it quickly for ${city} area vehicles. Call us to discuss your specific vehicle and we'll give you an honest assessment and timeline.`,
    `If your cylinder isn't on the truck, we source it fast for ${city} vehicles — call with your year, make, and model for a straight answer on timing and price.`,
    `For ${city} drivers, a quick call with your vehicle details gets you an honest parts-and-timeline answer before we roll.`,
    townAnchor(slug, "automotive", "card-4"),
  ],
});

const ctaP = sp(slug, "cta", [
  `Call 1st Capital Locksmith for on-site ignition cylinder replacement in ${city}. We come to you — no tow, no dealership wait.`,
  `One call brings ignition replacement to your ${city} location — cylinder, keys, and programming handled in a single visit.`,
  `Wherever the vehicle sits in ${city}, that's where we replace the ignition. Call for upfront pricing and a real timeline.`,
]);
---

<MainLayout
  title={`Ignition Replacement in ${city}, ${state} | 1st Capital Locksmith`}
  description={`Ignition cylinder replacement in ${city}, ${state} for all vehicle makes, on-site. Call (302) 735-0050.`}
>

  <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="bg-white border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-3">
      <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500 flex-wrap">
        <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-[#A61E22] transition font-medium">Home</a></li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-3 h-3 text-gray-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" /></svg><a href="/services/" class="hover:text-[#A61E22] transition font-medium">Services</a></li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-3 h-3 text-gray-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" /></svg><a href={`/services/automotive-locksmith/${slug}/`} class="hover:text-[#A61E22] transition font-medium">Automotive Locksmith in {city}</a></li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-3 h-3 text-gray-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" /></svg><span class="text-[#A61E22] font-semibold">Ignition Replacement — {city}, {state}</span></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://1stcapitallocksmithde.com/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Services", "item": "https://1stcapitallocksmithde.com/services/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": `Automotive Locksmith in ${city}`, "item": `https://1stcapitallocksmithde.com/services/automotive-locksmith/${slug}/` },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 4, "name": `Ignition Replacement in ${city}, ${state}`, "item": `https://1stcapitallocksmithde.com/services/automotive-locksmith/${slug}/ignition-replacement/` }
    ]
  })} />
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "LocalBusiness",
    "@id": "https://1stcapitallocksmithde.com",
    "name": "1st Capital Locksmith", "telephone": "+13027350050",
    "url": "https://1stcapitallocksmithde.com",
    "address": { "@type": "PostalAddress", "streetAddress": "2089 S Dupont Hwy #2", "addressLocality": "Dover", "addressRegion": "DE", "postalCode": "19901", "addressCountry": "US" },
    "geo": { "@type": "GeoCoordinates", "latitude": "39.1212111", "longitude": "-75.5331705" },
    "description": `Ignition cylinder replacement in ${city}, ${state}. On-site ignition replacement for all vehicle makes and models throughout ${county}, Delaware.`,
    "areaServed": { "@type": "City", "name": city, "containedInPlace": { "@type": "State", "name": "Delaware" } },
    "priceRange": "$$"
  })} />

  <!-- Schema: Service -->
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "Service",
    "name": `Ignition Replacement in ${city}, ${state}`,
    "serviceType": "Ignition Replacement",
    "provider": { "@type": "LocalBusiness", "name": "1st Capital Locksmith", "telephone": "+13027350050", "url": "https://1stcapitallocksmithde.com" },
    "areaServed": { "@type": "City", "name": city, "containedInPlace": { "@type": "State", "name": "Delaware" } }
  })} />

  <section class="relative min-h-105 flex items-center py-12 md:py-20" style="background-image: url('/images/ignition-replacement-technician.jpg'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#0E1B2F]/85"></div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 w-full">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <p class="text-[#9A9D62] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-sm mb-3">Automotive Locksmith · {city}, {state}</p>
          <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Ignition Replacement in {city}, {state}</h1>
          <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            {heroP}
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            {[
              { label: "Full Ignition Cylinder Replacement", href: "/services/ignition-replacement" },
              { label: "New Key Cutting After Replacement", href: "/services/car-key-replacement" },
              { label: "Transponder Key Programming", href: "/services/car-key-replacement" },
              { label: "Damaged Ignition Replacement", href: "/services/ignition-replacement" },
              { label: "Post-Extraction Cylinder Replacement", href: "/services/broken-key-extraction" },
              { label: "Worn or Cracked Ignition Cylinder", href: "/services/ignition-replacement" },
              { label: "All Vehicle Makes & Models", href: "/services/ignition-replacement" },
            ].map(({ label, href }) => (
              <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-gray-300">
                <span class="w-5 h-5 bg-[#A61E22] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-3 h-3 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
                </span>
                <a href={href} class="hover:text-white hover:underline transition">{label}</a>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-[#1A2B45] rounded-2xl p-8 border border-[#2A3B55]">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-5">On-Site Ignition Replacement in {city}</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4">
            {[
              { title: "Honest Assessment First", desc: "We always diagnose before recommending replacement — we only replace when repair is not a viable option." },
              { title: "New Keys Included", desc: "A new key is cut and programmed to your vehicle as part of every ignition replacement service in " + city + "." },
              { title: "All Vehicle Makes", desc: `We carry replacement ignition cylinders for domestic and import vehicles throughout ${city} and ${county}.` },
              { title: "Same-Visit Service", desc: "Most ignition replacements are completed in a single mobile service visit at your location in " + city + "." },
            ].map((item) => (
              <div class="flex gap-3 items-start">
                <span class="w-5 h-5 bg-[#A61E22] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-3 h-3 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
                </span>
                <div><p class="font-semibold text-white text-sm">{item.title}</p><p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">{item.desc}</p></div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-[#2A3B55]">
            <a href="tel:3027350050" class="block text-center bg-[#A61E22] text-white font-bold rounded-full py-3 px-6 hover:bg-[#8C181B] transition">Call (302) 735-0050</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-[#0E1B2F] py-8">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 text-center">
        <div><p class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#A61E22]">All Makes</p><p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mt-1">Domestic & Import Vehicles</p></div>
        <div><p class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#A61E22]">Mobile</p><p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mt-1">We Come to {city}</p></div>
        <div><p class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#A61E22]">Fast</p><p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mt-1">Quick Response in {city}</p></div>
        <div><p class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#A61E22]">No Damage</p><p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mt-1">Professional Entry Tools</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-[#F8F8F5] py-16">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="text-center mb-10">
        <p class="text-[#9A9D62] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-sm mb-3">Ignition Replacement in {city}</p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-3">Ignition Replacement Services in {city}, {state}</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-3">When Replacement Is Needed</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">{card1}</p>
          <div class="mt-4"><a href={`/services/automotive-locksmith/${slug}/ignition-repair/`} class="text-[#A61E22] font-semibold hover:underline text-sm">We try ignition repair first — learn more →</a></div>
          <div class="mt-4"><a href="/services/ignition-replacement/" class="text-[#A61E22] font-semibold hover:underline text-sm">Learn more about Ignition Replacement →</a></div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-3">Replacement with New Key Cutting</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">{card2}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-3">Post-Break-In Ignition Replacement</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">{card3}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-3">All Vehicle Makes & Models</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">{card4}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-white py-16">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="text-center mb-10">
        <p class="text-[#9A9D62] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-sm mb-3">More Services in {city}</p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-3">More Locksmith Services in {city}, {state}</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
        <a href={`/services/automotive-locksmith/${slug}/`} class="bg-[#F8F8F5] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-200 hover:border-[#A61E22] hover:shadow-md transition group">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1A1F22] text-base mb-2 group-hover:text-[#A61E22] transition">Automotive Locksmith in {city}, {state}</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Full automotive locksmith services in {city}.</p>
        </a>
        <a href={`/services/automotive-locksmith/${slug}/ignition-repair/`} class="bg-[#F8F8F5] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-200 hover:border-[#A61E22] hover:shadow-md transition group">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1A1F22] text-base mb-2 group-hover:text-[#A61E22] transition">Ignition Repair in {city}, {state}</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Ignition cylinder diagnosis and repair before considering replacement in {city}.</p>
        </a>
        <a href={`/services/automotive-locksmith/${slug}/car-key-replacement/`} class="bg-[#F8F8F5] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-200 hover:border-[#A61E22] hover:shadow-md transition group">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1A1F22] text-base mb-2 group-hover:text-[#A61E22] transition">Car Key Replacement in {city}, {state}</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Transponder key cutting and programming in {city}.</p>
        </a>
        <a href={`/services/emergency-locksmith/${slug}/broken-key-extraction/`} class="bg-[#F8F8F5] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-200 hover:border-[#A61E22] hover:shadow-md transition group">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1A1F22] text-base mb-2 group-hover:text-[#A61E22] transition">Broken Key Extraction in {city}, {state}</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Safe key fragment removal from ignition cylinders in {city}.</p>
        </a>
        <a href={`/services/automotive-locksmith/${slug}/car-lockout/`} class="bg-[#F8F8F5] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-200 hover:border-[#A61E22] hover:shadow-md transition group">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1A1F22] text-base mb-2 group-hover:text-[#A61E22] transition">Car Lockout Service in {city}, {state}</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Fast non-destructive car lockout service in {city}.</p>
        </a>
        <a href={`/services/automotive-locksmith/${slug}/key-fob-programming/`} class="bg-[#F8F8F5] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-200 hover:border-[#A61E22] hover:shadow-md transition group">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1A1F22] text-base mb-2 group-hover:text-[#A61E22] transition">Key Fob Programming in {city}, {state}</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Key fob replacement and programming in {city}.</p>
        </a>
        <a href={`/services/residential-locksmith/${slug}/`} class="bg-[#F8F8F5] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-200 hover:border-[#A61E22] hover:shadow-md transition group">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1A1F22] text-base mb-2 group-hover:text-[#A61E22] transition">Residential Locksmith in {city}, {state}</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">House lockouts, rekeying, and deadbolts in {city}.</p>
        </a>
        <a href={`/services/emergency-locksmith/${slug}/`} class="bg-[#F8F8F5] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-200 hover:border-[#A61E22] hover:shadow-md transition group">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1A1F22] text-base mb-2 group-hover:text-[#A61E22] transition">Emergency Locksmith in {city}, {state}</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Fast emergency locksmith response in {city}.</p>
        </a>
        <a href={`/service-areas/${slug}/`} class="bg-[#A61E22] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-[#A61E22] hover:bg-[#8C181B] transition">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-base mb-2">All Services in {city}, {state}</h3>
          <p class="text-white/80 text-sm">View all locksmith services in {city}, {state}.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <LocationLocalFlavor location={location} variant="automotive" />

  <section class="bg-[#0E1B2F] py-16">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Need an Ignition Replacement in {city}, {state}?</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8">{ctaP}</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="tel:3027350050" class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-[#A61E22] px-8 py-4 text-white font-bold text-lg hover:bg-[#8C181B] transition">Call (302) 735-0050</a>
        <a href="/contact/" class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-white px-8 py-4 text-white font-semibold hover:bg-white hover:text-[#1A1F22] transition">Get a Free Quote</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</MainLayout>


